ッセージも出来るのであれば頂きたいですっ…！\n\nご縁がありますように…\nよろしくお願いします！！\n神那レイア\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-EJnRN66efXkNFudK7-olbOVFQW6Mdg9", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Fushicho55/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6684a45/uploads/origins/36c55cae-5d30-4b66-b4ad-619dfc13c47a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=695eb81a19bf960d98bab2ee19ede826", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b6684a45/uploads/origins/36c55cae-5d30-4b66-b4ad-619dfc13c47a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=695eb81a19bf960d98bab2ee19ede826, https://si.imgix.net/b6684a45/uploads/origins/36c55cae-5d30-4b66-b4ad-619dfc13c47a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c0768be294d75f2a13cef58e2e9bf331 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b6684a45/uploads/origins/36c55cae-5d30-4b66-b4ad-619dfc13c47a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=60292dfcfbe3f6b589092491553f28d2 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1120324, "nc": 128}, {"path": "/@Fushicho55/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1120324, "client_id": 2237947, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/23e70105/uploads/origins/70332529-a985-4c62-a9c1-2ed551daeb69?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e8a0f6432c97ff2eed2b609d128a550", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23e70105